matter-wake-replay 7
# Ice and glass (docs/briefs/ice-glass.md). Creative mode hangs a column
# of ice under a block of stone and puts a pane of glass in the air. The
# tool digs the bottom of the ice: the whole column turns into one static
# body. A wide cut through it leaves the top hanging, static, and the
# rest falls. The tool digs the pane: it turns into a static body, and
# one more pixel dug shatters it into powder. Then a glass body is thrown
# right at 5 m/s and an ice body down at 10 m/s, and the glass one is dug
# where it lies and shatters too.
seed 1
size 480 270
scene sandbox
view 480 270
stream 64 4 512 12 60
budget 250000
tool 10 2000 4 circle
body wood 16 12 0 0 0
mode play
slots ice glass stone
materials 25c5f996225f3a12
ticks 600

# Stone, a column of ice under it, and a pane of glass, in creative mode.
10 230 30 P 3 0 0 brush 8 square mode creative
11 230 47 P 1 0 0
12 230 64 P 1 0 0
13 360 170 P 2 0 0
